      "writtenOn": "2023-03-02T11:35:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think `generated_headers` is the reason why Soong accepts such targets. I think Soong accepts any empty cc_static_library even if it doesn\u0027t include the `generated_headers`. \n\nThe reason I have `generated_headers` is for `export_generated_headers` attribute which is used to allow dependending modules to include those headers.",
